        <div class="design-story-panel active" data-story-panel="experience"><div class="mimo2-demo-notes"><button class="active" data-story-demo="home"><span>01 / HOME</span><b>一眼看懂今天该做什么</b><p>首页只突出一个主任务，学习数量与真实队列使用同一数据源。</p></button><button data-story-demo="learn"><span>02 / LEARN</span><b>渐进展示，降低信息压力</b><p>先建立图词关联，再通过翻卡逐步展开释义、音标、例句和助记。</p></button><button data-story-demo="exam"><span>03 / EXAM</span><b>四种题型验证真正掌握</b><p>中英、图片和发音交叉考核，答错后缩短复习间隔。</p></button><button data-story-demo="stats"><span>04 / GROWTH</span><b>让微小进步变得可感知</b><p>用连续天数、趋势与角色反馈，把抽象坚持变成可见成长。</p></button></div></div>
        <div class="design-story-panel" data-story-panel="brand"><div class="story-brand-copy"><span>COLOR & THEME</span><h3>一套配色，适配两种阅读环境。</h3><p>成长绿承担关键行动与完成反馈，中性色建立内容层级。点击主题查看真实界面效果。</p><div class="brand-theme-switch" role="group" aria-label="界面主题预览"><button class="active" data-story-theme="light"><i></i>浅色模式</button><button data-story-theme="dark"><i></i>深色模式</button></div></div><div class="story-color-board"><div class="story-color-primary"><span>PRIMARY / GROWTH</span><b>#00F25B</b></div><div style="--story-color:#191B1D;color:#fff"><b>#191B1D</b><small>深色背景</small></div><div style="--story-color:#4B5055;color:#fff"><b>#4B5055</b><small>次级信息</small></div><div style="--story-color:#9E9E9E;color:#fff"><b>#9E9E9E</b><small>辅助文本</small></div><div style="--story-color:#FFFFFF;color:#191B1D"><b>#FFFFFF</b><small>浅色背景</small></div></div></div>
